; A Control subtree under a HIDDEN Node2D ancestor — the ONE variable no other
; fixture moves. A non-Control ancestor contributes no node of its own and its
; Control descendants promote up, so a promoted Control that never consults the
; ancestor's `visible` draws a panel Godot hides entirely. The visible sibling
; exists only to prove the frame is not blank for some unrelated reason.

